[[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><p>- Open the bonnet.</p><p>1. Undo the upper bolts (1a) and nuts (1b) fixing the headlamp.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connector for the headlamp.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td><p>F011</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td><p>F010</p></td></tr></table></div><p>- Release the headlamp from the fitting using a suitable tool.</p><p>3. Remove the front headlamp.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244004472.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fasten the front headlamp securing it to the fitting and tightening the upper fixing bolt.</p><p>- Connect the electrical connector for the headlamp.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td><p>F011</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td><p>F010</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]